summary:
  A podcast search none of the directories answered reads as "No shows found".

history:
  With the directories out of reach the page said "No shows found", which
  tells the listener the show does not exist, and nothing asked again. The
  settle now counts the directories that answered; this forgets the count.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PodcastEngine.qml

find:
          podcastSearchUnreached = _podShowsHeard === 0;

replace:
          podcastSearchUnreached = _podShowsHeard < 0;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_podcastengine.qml::test_a_search_nobody_answered_is_not_no_shows_found.
  Line-neutral.
